OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after death of man
OL,4,Afound at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after another man was found at a
OL,8,Fhome in Worcestershire with serious
OL,9,Finjuries.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Wylds Lane,
OL,12,FWorcester, shortly after 21:00 BST on
OL,13,FTuesday, where they found the victim,
OL,14,Fbelieved to be 42-year-old Damian
OL,15,FBuczek.
OL,17,FHe was taken to hospital where he later
OL,18,Fdied from his injuries.
OL,20,FOn Thursday, a 46-year-old man was
OL,21,Farrested and remained in custody, West
OL,22,FMercia Police said.
